# Production build env — committed. Vite reads .env.production for `npm run build`.
# The worker URL is intentionally public: it's the endpoint every browser
# session calls anyway, and CORS on the Worker is locked to specific origins
# (localhost:5173, localhost:4173, iamdjem.github.io) so this URL by itself
# doesn't let anyone else call it from a browser.
#
# Anything secret (Cults API key, etc.) stays out of the frontend bundle —
# the user supplies it at runtime in the Cults Connect form and we ship it
# only as a per-request X-Cults-Api-Key header to the Worker.
VITE_WORKER_URL=https://modelprep-backend.iamdjem.workers.dev
